      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Cooke City’s chief industry is tourism, with winter skiing and snowmobiling drawing visitors to the area.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cooke_City%2C_Montana",
      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Cooke City Montana Museum on Main Street showcases local history and exhibits on Colter Pass and Silver Gate.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        7
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://discoveringmontana.com/towns/cooke-city/",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "From its northeast entrance, Cooke City offers stunning views of the Beartooth Range, serving as a common stop for travelers heading to Yellowstone.",
